      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also I second the part of having the max range be set by the world maker. The max could just simply be the range the world itself has, default or customized, and then you can just adjust it down lower as needed, that way you can't just crank it up to spy on people miles away in digital cyberspace. \nBasically a strong emphasis on it being JUST to lower the voice range.",
