  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-04-28T23:04:28.007Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As an organizer for crowded parties and gatherings, it came to my attention that some people love to hear everyone in the room (crowded noisy environment feeling), while others have trouble focusing on a conversation when constantly hearing everyone.\nWhile this is currently a setting for world builders only, that affects everyone in the world, it would be great if we can decide for ourselves with a local voice range setting in the menu, whether we want to hear people from all over the room or only a small range.\n(I would suggest keeping a maximum range setting to be set by the world builder)",
